    <div class="d2c-sribbon-content">
      <span class="d2c-sribbon-item">💎 100% IGI & GIA CERTIFIED NATURAL & LAB DIAMONDS</span>
      <span class="d2c-sribbon-sep">✦</span>
      <span class="d2c-sribbon-item">FREE TRY AT HOME IN 40+ INDIAN CITIES</span>
      <span class="d2c-sribbon-sep">✦</span>
      <span class="d2c-sribbon-item">100% LIFETIME BUYBACK & EXCHANGE VALUE</span>
